\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Experimental workflow, with illustrative keypoints showing a synthetic 3D knee edit. Endpoint and delta learn from noisy poses and clean projected references in separate runs, then fit a reference-supervised readout. Equation\nobreakspace  {}\ref  {eq:feature} defines the feature losses. Each development window is restored independently. Paired outputs and references determine asymmetry-change error; knee-angle trajectories and post hoc naming are scored per window. The development cohort is reused across studies. This diagram shows the frozen-encoder procedures; direct fitting jointly trains encoder and readout.}}{3}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:method}{{1}{3}{Experimental workflow, with illustrative keypoints showing a synthetic 3D knee edit. Endpoint and delta learn from noisy poses and clean projected references in separate runs, then fit a reference-supervised readout. Equation~\ref {eq:feature} defines the feature losses. Each development window is restored independently. Paired outputs and references determine asymmetry-change error; knee-angle trajectories and post hoc naming are scored per window. The development cohort is reused across studies. This diagram shows the frozen-encoder procedures; direct fitting jointly trains encoder and readout}{figure.1}{}}
